{"seq":14,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:32:45.459Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"a466d2b91ab34b4e2cac7fb78889c3dfbce20ca11a500c47977daf049348a98c","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's digests show:\n• Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It changed hands on 2026-05-04 (from Nadia Fennimore). Moss's 5/3 prep note says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest records the CRM reassignment that day.\n• Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato (\"Gideon's fleet account\" in the 4/27, 8/3 and 9/30 material; the 5/4 digest also notes he took over management that day).\n• Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato. The 9/30 digest calls it \"Gideon's medical account\" (the 12/1/2025 digest says the same). Moss's March 2025 digest had it as Nadia's, so it moved at some point. No digest I can see dates that move. Also, the digests say \"medical account\" rather than naming Orlavine in that line.\n• Quillfeather Outfitters: I can't confirm this one. The digests only call it \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\" and never name an owner. Nadia Fennimore is the one hosting their training and relaying their requests, so she's the likely owner, but that's my inference. Please check it against the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n\nSources: Moss digests 2026-09-30, 2026-05-04, 2026-04-27, 2025-12-01, 2025-03-10 and the 2026-05-03 Sunday prep note.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":15,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:32:50.295Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"21f02119d3a6256881b29142d549e048a4d3948ac7c3bc4079b7829d3c7c11b4","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I replied to Ruth in the #strategic-pod thread. Three of the four owners are clear from Moss's digests, and Quillfeather isn't.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato owns it. It changed hands from Nadia Fennimore on 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 prep note says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest records the CRM reassignment that day.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato owns it. The 4/27, 8/3 and 9/30 material calls it \"Gideon's fleet account\". The 5/4 digest says he took over management that day.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato appears to own it. The 9/30 digest calls it \"Gideon's medical account\", and the 12/1/2025 digest says the same. The digests say \"medical account\" rather than naming Orlavine on that line. The March 2025 digest had it as Nadia's, and none of the digests I can read dates that change.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't confirm an owner, because the digests never name one. Nadia Fennimore is the one hosting their training and relaying their requests, so she's the likely owner. That is my inference, and I told Ruth to check the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n\nI only used Moss's digests, which were addressed to Ruth, plus the 5/3 Sunday prep note. Nothing in the reply comes from channels she isn't in."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
